Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.51,0:00:02.97,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,I bring you a tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.35,0:00:08.66,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,The crown prince, Second Prince Albert,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.41,0:00:12.56,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,plans to lead\Na coup tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.23,0:00:15.99,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,and force His Majesty \Nto abdicate the throne.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.59,0:00:32.55,sign_generic,Title,0,0,0,,{\fade(109,0)\c&H4F7C81&\bord0\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs10\pos(320,142.5)}Born Blessed, So I'll Obtain Ultimate Power
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.59,0:00:32.55,sign_generic,Title,0,0,0,,{\fade(109,0)\p1\bord2\c&H291505&\alpha&H255&\3c&H2986A5&\fscx87\pos(311,141.167)}m 0 0 l 235 0 l 225 8 l 235 15 l 18 15 l 30 8 l 18 0
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.16,0:01:50.96,sign_generic,Title,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\b1\fade(522,721)\c&H00070B&\pos(320, 205)}Episode 12
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.16,0:01:50.96,sign_generic,Title,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\b1\fade(522,721)\c&H00070B&\pos(320, 225)}Nobility
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.28,0:01:54.79,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Albert?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:01:57.25,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,No, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.69,0:01:59.39,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You said your name was Olivia?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.88,0:02:02.21,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,How do you know this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.51,0:02:08.77,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,I am the daughter of Coil, a member of \Nformer First Prince Gilbert's household.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.77,0:02:10.18,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Coil, his butler?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.65,0:02:12.17,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You were born into the household?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.17,0:02:13.11,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.11,0:02:14.40,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Born into a household...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.40,0:02:20.24,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,That refers to a child born between \Ntwo servants of a prince's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.00,0:02:23.68,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Since that's the environment \Nthey grow up in,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.68,0:02:27.97,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,it's easy for them to swear \Nabsolute loyalty to that prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.99,0:02:33.64,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,I know all about how you managed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.64,0:02:36.96,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,to spare the First Prince's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:39.18,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,And yet, that man...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.56,0:02:43.85,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,I see. At the time, my \Nfather was probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.34,0:02:48.70,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,So I swore revenge and approached him...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.70,0:02:51.96,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,with this body my parents gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.59,0:02:55.57,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,And then I heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:59.32,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,Before the official proclamation \Nof his disinheritance,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.02,0:03:03.03,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,while he was still the crown prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.43,0:03:07.74,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,he would mobilize soldiers and \Ntake control of the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.15,0:03:14.02,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,What does Albert intend \Nto do to His Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.02,0:03:18.75,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,Force him to abdicate and become \Nan emperor emeritus, he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.14,0:03:24.84,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,I beg of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.84,0:03:27.33,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,My body, my very life...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.33,0:03:29.61,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,They are yours to use as you see fit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.61,0:03:33.12,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,Just, please... stop Crown Prince Albert!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.12,0:03:34.32,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.66,0:03:37.84,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.31,0:03:43.63,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,What did you do at Gilbert's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.63,0:03:47.72,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,I-I was an apprentice \Nbutler under my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.35,0:03:50.91,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Then you'll do that here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.91,0:03:52.86,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You'll be paid the same \Nas you were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:56.78,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,From tomorrow on, you don't \Nneed to do anything special.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:04:00.96,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,Why... would you treat me so well?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.72,0:04:06.04,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,When you lost your master, \Nyou tried to avenge him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.04,0:04:08.23,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I merely acknowledged your loyalty
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.23,0:04:10.63,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,in serving your master to the \Nend, even after his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.16,0:04:12.86,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,How remarkable you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.44,0:04:16.73,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,I humbly offer myself in your service!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.86,0:04:24.32,sign_generic,Text,0,0,0,,{\fs24\fnTimes New Roman\b1\blur2\shad6\fade(442,0)\c&HFDFEFE&\3c&HBDA090&\4c&H3D3437&\frz8.903\pos(142.667,238)\frx4\fry352}Dark
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.69,0:04:36.00,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.74,0:04:38.30,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I'm going out for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.30,0:04:40.87,Default,Gigi,0,0,0,,A-All right! Um... A carriage, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.87,0:04:42.49,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,No. I'll go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.49,0:04:43.29,Default,Gigi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.21,0:04:50.94,Default,Gigi,0,0,0,,B-But it's so late...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.94,0:04:51.69,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Gigi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.08,0:05:01.77,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,We shall await your return, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:03.29,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.43,0:05:10.80,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Please be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.69,0:05:18.18,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,If Albert intends to use \Nhis right of command,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.18,0:05:20.81,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,there's only one force he could lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.34,0:05:31.80,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,It's stationed at the Ministry \Nof Military Affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.87,0:05:43.74,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,A thousand men.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:49.17,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Since they're permanently stationed,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.09,0:05:53.11,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,they've been trained to obey the orders
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.11,0:05:56.48,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,of the superior officer in command \Nwithout a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.65,0:05:59.89,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.89,0:06:03.92,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Are you familiar with the \Nsaying, "Even water can rot"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:09.98,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Water that forgets to flow and \Nstays in one place too long
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.98,0:06:14.47,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,eventually stagnates and becomes \Na home for all manner of vermin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.90,0:06:17.86,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,The same can be said of a nation!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.40,0:06:22.88,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,His Majesty has forgotten \Nto flow for far too long,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.88,0:06:27.88,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,and now, vermin swarm around him in the \Nform of disloyal, treacherous retainers,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:30.46,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,trying to rot this country \Nfrom the inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.86,0:06:32.62,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Justice sides with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.17,0:06:38.45,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,I will return the empire you love to \Nthe hands in which it was meant to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.79,0:06:49.71,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Please hold, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.56,0:06:56.34,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Ah, Noah. What brings \Nyou here at this hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.34,0:06:58.84,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Please refrain from doing \Nanything senseless!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.84,0:07:00.69,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,There is still time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.32,0:07:04.15,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Who told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.15,0:07:06.66,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.66,0:07:11.28,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Brother, if you take this step, you \Nwill bring about your own ruin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.28,0:07:13.01,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,What of it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.01,0:07:16.53,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,I refuse to die while sitting \Naround doing nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.88,0:07:18.17,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Die?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.02,0:07:23.45,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You haven't read His Majesty's edict \Nregarding your disinheritance?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.15,0:07:28.76,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You don't know the agony\NHis Majesty felt writing that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.71,0:07:34.27,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,No matter what you may have done, \Nhe did not disclose it publicly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.15,0:07:42.44,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,His Majesty wants you to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.44,0:07:45.11,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,He agonized over a way to \Nallow you to keep your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.11,0:07:47.73,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,So I should be content with \Njust being a prince?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.23,0:07:51.15,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Thirty-five years...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.45,0:07:53.10,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,I waited thirty-five years!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.67,0:07:57.08,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,I believed that I would sit \Non that throne one day...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.47,0:08:00.47,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,that I would rule this empire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.98,0:08:03.55,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,And this is what I get?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.44,0:08:09.65,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,His Majesty seems to value his own \Nlife above all in his old age.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:13.11,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,If he insists on clinging \Npathetically to the throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.11,0:08:18.36,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,I will oust him with military might, \Nas is befitting of a military nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.76,0:08:21.73,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Content with just being a prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.41,0:08:25.72,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,From the perspective \Nof the common folk,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.72,0:08:29.34,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,as well as my own,\Nthe status of prince is most noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.60,0:08:32.98,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,They do what they think is best,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.43,0:08:37.41,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,and have the power to act in \Nthe interests of the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.41,0:08:39.16,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,A prince is born blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.37,0:08:43.54,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,But since Albert was \Nonce the crown prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:47.91,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,being reduced to that status \Nmust be akin to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.91,0:08:50.44,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,This vast difference \Nin values must mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.19,0:08:54.56,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,You insist on trying to stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.56,0:08:55.39,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.80,0:08:58.31,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:09:02.14,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Well, that's the kind of \Nyounger brother you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.61,0:09:08.44,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Apprehend Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.44,0:09:10.28,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,He's a traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.53,0:09:13.88,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,A thousand of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.97,0:09:26.88,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,They still follow orders faithfully, even \Nif ordered to attack a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.88,0:09:29.33,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,They are indeed well-trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:32.65,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,All the more reason I can't \Ninvolve them in this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.90,0:09:39.79,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.74,0:09:43.27,italics,Leviathan,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.98,0:09:50.14,italics,Leviathan,0,0,0,,Summon the power you \Ndesire by its true name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.58,0:09:53.15,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,The power... I desire...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.36,0:09:59.36,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Go, Luthier!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.36,0:10:00.04,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.89,0:10:04.20,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Bahamut!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.80,0:10:19.79,italics,Leviathan,0,0,0,,Flowing water allows no contamination.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.06,0:10:26.35,Default,Humbaba,0,0,0,,A breath of wind becomes the \Neyes and ears that know all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.00,0:10:32.85,italics,Behemoth,0,0,0,,The earth is the foundation to \Nsupport the feet that move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:35.82,italics,Bahamut,0,0,0,,And flame...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.87,0:10:45.96,italics,Bahamut,0,0,0,,manifests here as the \Npower to burn all to ash!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.08,0:10:52.32,Default,SoldierB,0,0,0,,Wh-What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.42,0:11:07.47,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.27,0:11:09.40,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Don't kill any soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.56,0:11:31.95,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,It's over, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.09,0:11:36.96,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,You'll kill me? You? {\i1}You{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.29,0:11:41.66,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,No. I will not take your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.25,0:11:47.67,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,His Majesty would most certainly be sad \Nif one of his sons killed another.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.01,0:11:49.27,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.27,0:11:51.03,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Poison?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.03,0:11:52.40,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.40,0:11:56.19,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I will not kill you myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.74,0:11:59.86,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,but I will not stop you \Nfrom killing yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.84,0:12:03.61,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Be serious! Who do you think you are?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.97,0:12:05.31,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Have you considered?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.45,0:12:11.87,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,If I kill you, then you and all \Nyour family and subordinates
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.87,0:12:15.10,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,will be executed as traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.10,0:12:19.52,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,But if you kill yourself now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.52,0:12:22.51,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,the story will be that you led \Na force to attempt mutiny,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.51,0:12:25.33,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,but stopped at the last moment \Nand killed yourself instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.66,0:12:30.55,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You cannot erase this act from existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.98,0:12:35.03,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,But you can still spare your \Nfamily and subordinates,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.03,0:12:38.53,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,and your eldest son can \Nstill succeed you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.01,0:12:42.69,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,The choice is yours, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:45.73,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Who would fall for such nonsense?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.07,0:12:48.04,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Foster! Howard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.42,0:12:49.74,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Apprehend this boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.34,0:12:57.91,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,It's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.91,0:13:02.39,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,I'll kill that dotard and \Ntake the throne if I must—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.23,0:13:07.20,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.20,0:13:10.31,Default,Foster,0,0,0,,We can no longer follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.31,0:13:13.14,Default,Howard,0,0,0,,Even under these \Ncircumstances, Prince Noah
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.14,0:13:16.44,Default,Howard,0,0,0,,showed consideration for your \Nfamily and subordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.76,0:13:18.48,Default,Howard,0,0,0,,Yet {\i1}this{\i0} is what you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.48,0:13:23.03,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Are you mad?! I'm telling you \Nnot to entertain his nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.03,0:13:23.93,Default,Howard,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.52,0:13:25.65,Default,Howard,0,0,0,,Do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.42,0:13:30.46,Default,Howard,0,0,0,,Do you remember the 120 people \Nyou sacrificed to the miasma
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.46,0:13:34.66,Default,Howard,0,0,0,,when you lifted the seal on \NLeviathan all those years ago?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:42.88,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,So that's what...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.88,0:13:46.10,Default,Howard,0,0,0,,My older brother was one of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.10,0:13:47.64,Default,Howard,0,0,0,,My friend from childhood, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:50.40,Default,Foster,0,0,0,,My father was among them, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.40,0:13:53.36,Default,Howard,0,0,0,,I can't follow you any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.36,0:13:54.95,Default,Howard,0,0,0,,You can't expect me to!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.95,0:13:58.54,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Nonsense! I am the crown prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.54,0:14:00.35,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Your lives belong to m—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.04,0:14:05.12,Default,Foster,0,0,0,,Prince Noah, it seems the\Ncrown prince regrets his actions
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.12,0:14:07.28,Default,Foster,0,0,0,,and has chosen to commit suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.28,0:14:07.95,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.39,0:14:09.47,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.35,0:14:11.32,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.81,0:14:12.85,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.87,0:14:24.75,Default,Olivia,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.70,0:14:33.10,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Y-You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:36.30,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten your debt \Nto me for taking you in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.14,0:14:41.85,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,S-Stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.29,0:14:53.09,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Damn... you all...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.09,0:14:57.45,Default,Albert,0,0,0,,Who do you... think I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.81,0:15:07.46,italics,Albert,0,0,0,,Thirty-five years...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.01,0:15:10.07,italics,Albert,0,0,0,,I waited thirty-five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.61,0:15:13.88,italics,Albert,0,0,0,,I believed that I would sit \Non that throne one day...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.88,0:15:16.47,italics,Albert,0,0,0,,that I would rule this empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.05,0:15:28.35,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.64,0:15:31.74,Default,Foster,0,0,0,,Prince Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.36,0:15:41.66,Default,Foster,0,0,0,,Tragically, Prince Albert, the man \Nwho led us, has committed suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.66,0:15:44.98,Default,Howard,0,0,0,,His treacherous ambitions led him \Nto take command of our army,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.98,0:15:48.99,Default,Howard,0,0,0,,but he realized the gravity of his \Ncrime and deeply regretted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.47,0:15:52.84,Default,Howard,0,0,0,,In his last moments, he begged that \Nhis bereaved family be shown mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.13,0:15:57.09,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Yes. My brother attempted a coup,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.09,0:15:59.66,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,but due to a tip from a \Nloyal household member
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.55,0:16:03.28,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,and the bravery of his retainers in \Nrisking their lives to stop him,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.83,0:16:06.32,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,he got no farther than taking \Ncommand of some soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:09.49,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Therefore, under imperial law,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.49,0:16:11.71,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,the informant and retainers \Nwill be rewarded,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.14,0:16:14.60,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,and other household members \Nwill be overlooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.27,0:16:19.52,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I will encourage His Majesty to have \Nmy brother's eldest son succeed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.89,0:16:21.69,Default,Foster/Howard,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.45,0:16:31.92,sign_generic,Text,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,0)\an7\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\c&HFFFCF4&\3c&HCDAFA0&\bord0.75\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H7D605F&\pos(14,20)}Name: Noah Ararat, Thirteenth Imperial Prince \NSex: Male \NTitle: Minister-Prince of Justice \NLevel: 3 \N\NHP: E+E\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hFire: F+A \NMP: F+E\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hWater: E+S \NStrength: E+E\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hWind: F+F \NStamina: F+E\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hEarth: F+F \NIntelligence: F+E\h\h\h\hLight: F+C \NSpirit: F+E\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hDark: F+F \NSpeed: F+E \NDexterity: F+E \NLuck: F+E
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.45,0:16:31.92,sign_generic,Text,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,0)\an7\bord2\shad2\blur1\p1\fscy220\alpha&H50&\c&H5E4E3C&\3c&HF8D6AE&\4c&HB7775D&}m 0 0 l 268 0 268 88 0 88
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.09,0:16:25.98,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,My basic abilities went way up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.98,0:16:28.19,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,These two must be very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.72,0:16:31.92,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Albert had subordinates \Nthis talented turn on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.72,0:16:35.88,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,People really are treasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.76,0:16:39.87,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,But since he didn't appreciate that,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.87,0:16:42.83,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,his coup was doomed to fail either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.98,0:16:55.24,Default,Noizhill,0,0,0,,So this is where you've been.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.23,0:17:02.86,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Just a moment ago, this box reacted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.40,0:17:07.41,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Perhaps Noah's magic sword \Nhas begun to awaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.41,0:17:10.97,Default,Noizhill,0,0,0,,Given Prince Noah's talent, \NI can believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.06,0:17:18.51,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,So... what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.18,0:17:25.46,Default,Noizhill,0,0,0,,After receiving word around the same \Ntime we did, Noah rushed to the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.46,0:17:27.58,Default,Noizhill,0,0,0,,And the crown prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.22,0:17:33.72,Default,Noizhill,0,0,0,,took his own life with poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.05,0:17:35.61,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.12,0:17:43.25,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Leave me alone for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.30,0:17:55.70,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Noah, even at a time like \Nthis, you are remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.45,0:17:58.37,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,And so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.28,0:18:01.22,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Gilbert Ararat
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.97,0:18:04.78,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,and Albert Ararat,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.35,0:18:09.99,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,the two princes who attempted to murder \Nthe emperor and take his throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.99,0:18:12.46,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,disappeared from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.21,0:18:15.57,Default,Audrey,0,0,0,,As a result,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.75,0:18:22.97,Default,Audrey,0,0,0,,the Meeres Empire saw the beginning of a \Nnew era of peace like none before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.93,0:18:28.21,Default,Anya,0,0,0,,Wow! That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.21,0:18:32.68,Default,Anya,0,0,0,,And that prince was around the \Nsame age as you, right, Sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.68,0:18:35.45,Default,Anya,0,0,0,,And yet he... That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.52,0:18:39.73,Default,Anya,0,0,0,,And then? What happened next?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.87,0:18:44.65,Default,Audrey,0,0,0,,I know not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.65,0:18:45.44,Default,Anya,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.79,0:18:48.43,Default,Audrey,0,0,0,,Because this story...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.06,0:18:54.98,sign_generic,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnTimes New Roman\fs15\fade(320,434)\bord0.25\shad1.5\an2\pos(320,311.333)\c&HE7E5DD&\3c&H000000&\4c&H341E13&}Three Years Later
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.61,0:19:00.61,sign_generic,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnTimes New Roman\fs15\fade(320,434)\bord0.25\shad1.5\an2\pos(320,311.333)\c&HE7E5DD&\3c&H000000&\4c&H341E13&}Nishil, Capital of Almeria
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.04,0:19:08.26,Default,Gigi,0,0,0,,Look at this, Head Maid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.79,0:19:11.37,Default,Gigi,0,0,0,,It's from Evelyn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.37,0:19:13.68,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Oh, so it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.68,0:19:15.45,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Let's take our time reading it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.45,0:19:18.30,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,We'll never finish if we \Ndon't work efficiently.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.01,0:19:19.05,top,Maids,0,0,0,,Prince Noah is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.60,0:19:20.93,Default,Gigi,0,0,0,,There's still more?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.05,0:19:20.63,top,Maids,0,0,0,,He's more popular than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.63,0:19:22.49,top,Maids,0,0,0,,Still, this is way too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.93,0:19:25.41,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,They're for both his fifteenth birthday
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.49,0:19:23.32,top,Maids,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.41,0:19:28.59,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,and his relocation to Almeria \Nto officially rule as its lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.95,0:19:30.96,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,There are still two more rooms' worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:34.52,Default,Gigi,0,0,0,,Really? He gets more \Nand more every year...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.52,0:19:36.45,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Well, he's Prince Noah, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.73,0:19:42.31,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,That just shows how many \Npeople he has saved,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.19,0:19:49.70,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,and how many people want \Nto be of use to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.67,0:19:55.08,Default,Gigi,0,0,0,,Our master is amazing, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.08,0:19:56.87,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Yes, he truly is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.47,0:20:01.24,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Well, if you would finish up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.24,0:20:02.13,Default,Gigi,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.88,0:20:17.49,Default,Audrey,0,0,0,,Your skill is as impressive as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.49,0:20:18.69,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.05,0:20:21.52,Default,Audrey,0,0,0,,What would you like to do for breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.52,0:20:23.01,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I'll have it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.01,0:20:24.56,Default,Audrey,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.86,0:20:26.02,Default,Audrey,0,0,0,,Zoey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.02,0:20:27.57,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.75,0:20:36.82,Default,Audrey,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.82,0:20:37.84,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.47,0:20:40.00,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,It's just about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.36,0:20:41.35,Default,Audrey,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.81,0:20:45.44,Default,Audrey,0,0,0,,My fifteenth birthday, when \NI am stripped of my surname.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.44,0:20:47.72,Default,Audrey,0,0,0,,How I have long waited for the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.15,0:20:50.58,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,But you'll be losing your surname.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.04,0:20:53.09,Default,Audrey,0,0,0,,That makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.09,0:20:59.06,Default,Audrey,0,0,0,,Because this means I finally, \Nofficially become your wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.34,0:21:01.25,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Don't be so impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.25,0:21:05.84,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Either way, I have no intention
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.84,0:21:09.10,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,of giving the one I have welcomed \Nover my threshold to anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.10,0:21:10.05,Default,Audrey,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.72,0:21:14.52,Default,Indra,0,0,0,,I was talking to the emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.52,0:21:17.56,Default,Indra,0,0,0,,and it sounds like one of those \Nthree will be next in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.21,0:21:22.59,Default,Indra,0,0,0,,The fourth prince, Henry...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.64,0:21:28.69,Default,Indra,0,0,0,,The eighth prince, Oscar...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.73,0:21:35.22,Default,Indra,0,0,0,,But the one he's hoping \Nfor is... that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.71,0:21:37.09,Default,Reina,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.73,0:21:38.98,Default,Jessie,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.19,0:21:40.36,Default,Anna,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.73,0:21:41.98,Default,Gigi,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.20,0:21:43.68,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.75,0:21:59.05,Default,Indra,0,0,0,,I think I'll go ahead and \Nbet it all on that boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:02.80,Default,Audrey,0,0,0,,Take care, Prince Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.55,0:22:05.42,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.45,0:22:12.97,sign_generic,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an3\fade(443,0)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&HC3D0DD&\3c&H374B69&\blur1\bord1.5\fs10\pos(302.667,258.667)}Translation:\NTiming:\NEditing:\NQuality Control:
